3-image-klein-comfy/resolve/main/text_encoders/qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors)\n\n**vae**\n\n- [flux2-vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/black-forest-labs/flux-3-image-klein-comfy/resolve/main/vae/flux2-vae.safetensors)\n\n\n## Model Storage Location\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   ├── 📂 diffusion_models/\n│   │   └── flux3_image_klein_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 text_encoders/\n│   │   └── qwen3vl_4b_int8_convrot.safetensors\n│   └── 📂 vae/\n│       └── flux2-vae.safetensors\n```\n\n## Report Issue\n\nNote: Please update ComfyUI first ([guide](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)) and prepare required models. Desktop/Cloud updates follow stable releases, so some nightly-supported models may not be available yet.\n\n- Cannot run / runtime errors: [ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / frontend issues: [ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- Workflow issues: [workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 650], "pos": [-665.0496826171875, -199.342529296875], "id": 26, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#222", "widgets_values": ["## FLUX.3 image-small: editing\n\nSame files and sampler settings as text-to-image (50 steps, cfg 3.5, euler / simple).\n\n**References**: plug more input image to the `Set Reference Multi Latent` node, the first one is `<ref_image_0>` in the prompt, the next `<ref_image_1>`, and so on. Add every reference to **both** the positive and the negative, as the reference pipeline does.\n\n**Size**: the reference is scaled to ~1 MP here and the output latent takes its size. BFL's pipeline keeps references at native size (up to ~16 MP): raise the megapixels for more reference detail at a higher cost.\n\n**Prompting**: write a full caption of the result, with the edit folded in."], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Notes", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [360, 270], "pos": [-568.72021484375, 545.1605224609375], "id": 10, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"}, "order": 15}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["change the dress color to red"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "Positive Prompt", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [450, 250], "pos": [-620.932373046875, -543.319091796875], "id": 65, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 16}, {"outputs": [{"name": "OPT_CONNECTION", "links": [], "label": "OPT_CONNECTION", "dir": 4, "type": "*"}], "color": "#222", "shape": 1, "inputs": [{"name": "SamplerCustomAdvanced", "link": 102, "label": "", "dir": 3, "type": "*"}, {"name": "KSampler", "link": 103, "dir": 3, "type": "*"}, {"name": "", "dir": 3, "type": "*"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "Fast Bypasser (rgthree)", "title": "sd / KSampler", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [546.9668579101562, 230.15725708007812], "pos": [-96.90216827392578, -531.1199951171875], "id": 83, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "toggleRestriction": "default"}, "order": 29}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "links": [], "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "links": [79], "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [530, 620], "pos": [2